1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:11,430
Given that a number of states have spoken about Palestine directly, we have prepared three replies, which we will read one after the other, and we kindly ask for your indulgence in that regard.

2
00:00:11,850 --> 00:00:14,490
We will first respond to Israel's statement.

3
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:26,420
Mr. Chair, at the outset, let us remind Israel that our name is not the Palestinian Authority, but the state of Palestine.

4
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:35,240
Sure, your finance minister said at an event in Paris earlier this year, there is no such thing as a Palestinian people.

5
00:00:35,920 --> 00:00:49,660
And your prime minister on the 24th of September held up a map at the General Assembly entitled The New Middle East, in which Palestine was deleted and replaced entirely with Israel.

6
00:00:49,660 --> 00:01:03,820
But if your government is annexationist and racist, this body is not, and we ask you to kindly adhere to UN protocol and nomenclature and to show respect to all stakeholders in this room.

7
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:16,880
Let us also remind the Israeli delegate that the lack of rules of procedure for this meeting does not give carte blanche to lose all sense of decorum when speaking to interlocutors in this room.

8
00:01:16,880 --> 00:01:23,880
To the other states and civil society in the room, let me simplify Israel's statement for you.

9
00:01:24,860 --> 00:01:33,000
Other than throwing insults around and making grave, baseless accusations, Israel said something that should make all of you shudder.

10
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:35,220
It effectively said,

11
00:01:35,220 --> 00:02:05,200
And so, according to Israel, it can kill them,

12
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:10,340
And then have the audacity to come to this room and tell the world with a straight face,

13
00:02:10,780 --> 00:02:13,600
We are acting in accordance with international law.

14
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:21,580
The death of each of the over 11,350 people killed over the past month,

15
00:02:22,020 --> 00:02:29,380
Be it children, journalists, UN staff, the sick, the elderly, according to Israel, was justified.

16
00:02:29,380 --> 00:02:34,340
Think about that for a moment, and let it give you pause.

17
00:02:37,420 --> 00:02:46,760
Anyone espousing this warped logic has no shred of humanity, no sense of morality, and no knowledge of legality.

18
00:02:47,320 --> 00:02:48,640
But guess what?

19
00:02:49,340 --> 00:02:54,000
Your carpet explanation for carpet bombing will not fly.

20
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:56,000
People are not fools.

21
00:02:56,000 --> 00:03:03,880
The people in this room are seasoned diplomats, who are well-read, have a knowledge of history,

22
00:03:04,380 --> 00:03:14,820
And many of whom have seen your government make the same arguments during your six previous military aggressions on Gaza in the past 15 years.

23
00:03:14,820 --> 00:03:25,540
They have seen you resort to collective punishment, targeting of Palestinian children, journalists, medical staff, aid workers, before.

24
00:03:26,260 --> 00:03:33,720
They have seen you forcibly transfer our communities, colonize our lands, demolish our homes,

25
00:03:33,720 --> 00:03:42,720
and evict families from their own properties, since the 7th of October, and for the 75 years that preceded it.

26
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:48,360
They have seen your state-sponsored disinformation campaign before.

27
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:50,920
Again, not fools.

28
00:03:51,320 --> 00:03:53,260
Don't insult our intelligence.

29
00:03:54,420 --> 00:03:58,260
By saying that it is acting in accordance with international law,

30
00:03:58,260 --> 00:04:05,820
Israel is effectively saying the UN Secretary General, the UN High Commissioner for Human Rights,

31
00:04:06,200 --> 00:04:14,480
the WHO, UNICEF, OCHA, UN Special Rapporteurs, the UN Independent Commission of Inquiry on the situation,

32
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:22,340
human rights organizations worldwide, disarmament NGOs worldwide, humanitarian NGOs worldwide,

33
00:04:22,760 --> 00:04:26,400
countless legal experts are all wrong.

34
00:04:26,400 --> 00:04:32,810
Everyone is lying about Israel violating international law,

35
00:04:32,950 --> 00:04:40,090
and we are asked instead to believe Israel, the state that is actually doing the indiscriminate killing.

36
00:04:41,390 --> 00:04:45,650
It is interesting that by saying even wars have rules,

37
00:04:46,110 --> 00:04:49,590
Israel quoted the very same UN Secretary General,

38
00:04:49,590 --> 00:04:59,350
whose resignation it has called for, because he dared to say that Israel has a history of occupying Palestinian land.

39
00:05:00,150 --> 00:05:06,030
The dissonance of hearing the Israeli representative talk about wars having rules,

40
00:05:06,450 --> 00:05:08,010
as it commits genocide,

41
00:05:08,730 --> 00:05:14,610
and breaches every rule in the book, live on our TV screens, is quite something.

42
00:05:14,610 --> 00:05:20,950
To Israel we say we see through your PR and disinformation.

43
00:05:20,950 --> 00:05:24,750
The whole world sees through your PR and disinformation.

44
00:05:25,290 --> 00:05:30,190
The millions of people filling the streets in every major capital of the world,

45
00:05:30,850 --> 00:05:32,690
calling you out for genocide,

46
00:05:33,230 --> 00:05:35,530
sees through your PR and disinformation.

47
00:05:35,530 --> 00:05:39,750
Perhaps you think that with your incendiary rhetoric,

48
00:05:39,750 --> 00:05:46,590
we will all forget the incitement, the declarations and acts of Israeli officials,

49
00:05:46,730 --> 00:05:48,170
the people you represent,

50
00:05:48,750 --> 00:05:50,310
to wipe out Gaza,

51
00:05:50,750 --> 00:05:53,550
to drop a nuclear bomb on the Palestinian people,

52
00:05:53,710 --> 00:05:57,610
to destroy the human animals and children of darkness.

53
00:05:57,610 --> 00:06:03,450
Perhaps you think that your constant intimidation and threatening language

54
00:06:03,450 --> 00:06:08,370
will make everyone overlook the fact that Israel is, as we speak,

55
00:06:08,750 --> 00:06:12,090
killing babies, youth, women, men, elderly,

56
00:06:12,330 --> 00:06:17,950
no one too small or too old or too sick to be spared its wrath.

57
00:06:18,750 --> 00:06:22,930
Perhaps you think that by cutting off telecommunications

58
00:06:22,930 --> 00:06:26,610
and imposing yet another blackout on Gaza,

59
00:06:27,070 --> 00:06:29,250
you can continue to commit genocide

60
00:06:29,250 --> 00:06:35,870
while avoiding the annoyance of people being able to use their phones and computers to report on it.

61
00:06:36,450 --> 00:06:42,070
Perhaps you think that as your trigger-happy soldiers continue to kill journalists,

62
00:06:42,610 --> 00:06:44,310
41 so far,

63
00:06:44,710 --> 00:06:48,390
the highest number of journalists killed over a four-week period

64
00:06:48,390 --> 00:06:51,810
than in any conflict in the last three decades,

65
00:06:51,810 --> 00:06:56,430
you think that no one will be left to expose your crimes.

66
00:06:57,370 --> 00:07:01,030
Perhaps you think that by trying to silence anyone

67
00:07:01,030 --> 00:07:03,410
who tries to speak about your crimes,

68
00:07:03,810 --> 00:07:06,410
the international law violations of a state,

69
00:07:06,910 --> 00:07:10,230
by calling them either anti-Semites or terror supporters,

70
00:07:10,670 --> 00:07:11,870
people will be silent.

71
00:07:12,810 --> 00:07:15,750
And your intimidation campaign knows no bounds.

72
00:07:15,750 --> 00:07:22,750
They attack Palestinians, Jews, Israelis, UN officials, politicians, parliamentarians,

73
00:07:23,930 --> 00:07:27,010
university professors, and anyone worldwide

74
00:07:27,010 --> 00:07:30,650
who calls you out for your violations of international law.

75
00:07:30,970 --> 00:07:32,430
But guess what?

76
00:07:32,810 --> 00:07:36,230
Your intimidation and silencing will not work.

77
00:07:36,650 --> 00:07:39,270
We, along with all peace-loving nations

78
00:07:39,270 --> 00:07:42,430
and along with all people of conscience around the world,

79
00:07:42,630 --> 00:07:43,930
will not be silent.

80
00:07:43,930 --> 00:07:47,070
We will continue to call you out on your crimes,

81
00:07:47,450 --> 00:07:49,850
to call for accountability for your violations,

82
00:07:50,390 --> 00:07:54,710
for sanctions as your government continues to reject calls for a ceasefire,

83
00:07:55,110 --> 00:07:56,550
to massacre our people,

84
00:07:56,750 --> 00:08:00,650
and to entrench your colonial occupation and apartheid regime.

85
00:08:01,430 --> 00:08:04,930
Something your country should have learned over the past 75 years

86
00:08:04,930 --> 00:08:10,310
is that the Palestinian people are a people who refuse to disappear.

87
00:08:10,390 --> 00:08:16,150
And your nuclear threats and your bombs and your tanks and your bulldozers

88
00:08:16,150 --> 00:08:19,790
will never break the Palestinian people's will to be free

89
00:08:19,790 --> 00:08:24,750
and to live in the dignity and peace to which all people are entitled.

90
00:08:24,750 --> 00:08:33,010
Unlike you, we have consistently stood in this forum calling for respect for international law,

91
00:08:33,010 --> 00:08:36,470
for ethical principles to guide state behavior,

92
00:08:36,930 --> 00:08:38,390
for peace over war,

93
00:08:38,890 --> 00:08:41,310
for humanity over national interests,

94
00:08:41,770 --> 00:08:44,050
for disarmament over destruction.

95
00:08:45,270 --> 00:08:49,350
Once again, we stand in this forum to call on all states

96
00:08:49,350 --> 00:08:52,670
to respect and ensure respect for international law.

97
00:08:53,090 --> 00:08:56,430
Let the law be the measure by which all are judged,

98
00:08:56,430 --> 00:09:01,270
not propaganda and hateful, biased spins steeped in racism.

99
00:09:01,990 --> 00:09:07,790
And to Israel's absurd assertion that Palestinians have a problem with people of Jewish faith

100
00:09:07,790 --> 00:09:12,270
and give the impression that this is a religious conflict,

101
00:09:12,450 --> 00:09:14,490
let us say it loud and clear.

102
00:09:14,490 --> 00:09:18,330
This is not and has never been about religion.

103
00:09:19,050 --> 00:09:23,370
Had the occupiers of our land or the violators of our rights

104
00:09:23,370 --> 00:09:29,930
been Muslim, Christian, Buddhist, Hindu, atheist, or of any other conviction,

105
00:09:30,270 --> 00:09:32,690
we would have called them out all the same.

106
00:09:32,690 --> 00:09:38,550
Palestine has always been multi-racial, multi-ethnic, and multi-religious.

107
00:09:39,050 --> 00:09:45,010
People of Jewish faith have lived in historic Palestine as Palestinians for centuries.

108
00:09:45,670 --> 00:09:48,590
We consider them to be our brothers and sisters.

109
00:09:49,390 --> 00:09:52,110
And since the memory of the Holocaust has been invoked,

110
00:09:52,450 --> 00:09:54,810
let us also say loud and clear,

111
00:09:55,190 --> 00:10:01,330
we have the greatest of solidarity with both the victims and survivors of the Holocaust.

112
00:10:01,330 --> 00:10:06,570
It was not Palestinians that committed that horrific genocide,

113
00:10:06,970 --> 00:10:09,790
but the fascist forces that spawned from Europe.

114
00:10:10,170 --> 00:10:16,050
And it is unconscionable that a number of European leaders are again beating the drum

115
00:10:16,050 --> 00:10:19,130
as another genocide is now underway in Gaza.

116
00:10:19,630 --> 00:10:25,650
We are united with those hundreds of thousands of Jews around the world,

117
00:10:25,790 --> 00:10:29,010
including from organizations like Jewish Voice for Peace,

118
00:10:29,010 --> 00:10:31,690
if not now, Naamud UK,

119
00:10:32,090 --> 00:10:37,210
who are calling out this genocide and chanting in the streets of New York,

120
00:10:37,550 --> 00:10:41,430
London, Paris, Berlin, Sydney, Toronto,

121
00:10:41,690 --> 00:10:45,250
and all major Western cities so that their governments can hear?

122
00:10:45,810 --> 00:10:47,810
Not in our name.

123
00:10:48,150 --> 00:10:49,770
End the genocide in Gaza.

124
00:10:50,110 --> 00:10:54,150
With them, we stand together to end this pain and suffering.

125
00:10:54,150 --> 00:10:57,070
Together, we will not allow this to happen.

126
00:10:57,350 --> 00:10:58,990
Never again is now.

